{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17422","headline":"赠郑国庄穆公主挽歌二首 二 · 权德舆","name":"赠郑国庄穆公主挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧馆闭平阳，容车啓寿堂。\n霜凝蕣英落，风度薤歌长。\n淑德图书在，皇慈礼命彰。\n凄凉霸川曲，垄树已成行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}